    {
      "id": "p57:b9:l0:s0-0",
      "page": 57,
      "at": [
        9,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "The local anesthetic bupivacaine (marketed as Marcaine) is on the World Health Organization List of ",
      "rect": [
        70.8239974975586,
        184.82333374023438,
        526.7430419921875,
        197.04461669921875
      ],
      "point": [
        70.8239974975586,
        194.65997314453125
      ],
      "font": "Times New Roman",
      "font_role": "serif",
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "국소 마취제인 부피바카인(상품명 Marcaine)은 세계보건기구의 필수 의약품 목록에"
    },
    {
      "id": "p57:b9:l1:s0-0",
      "page": 57,
      "at": [
        9,
        1,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "Essential Medicines. Although the drug is currently used as a racemic mixture, it was demonstrated ",
      "rect": [
        70.8239974975586,
        199.46334838867188,
        526.84228515625,
        211.68463134765625
      ],
      "point": [
        70.8239974975586,
        209.29998779296875
      ],
      "font": "Times New Roman",
      "font_role": "serif",
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "포함되어 있다. 이 약물은 라세미 혼합물로 사용되지만, 한 거울상 이성질체인"
    },
    {
      "id": "p57:b9:l2:s0-0",
      "page": 57,
      "at": [
        9,
        2,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "that one enantiomer of bupivacaine, levobupivacaine, is less cardiotoxic and, therefore, safer than the ",
      "rect": [
        70.8239974975586,
        213.98336791992188,
        527.0454711914062,
        226.20465087890625
      ],
      "point": [
        70.8239974975586,
        223.82000732421875
      ],
      "font": "Times New Roman",
      "font_role": "serif",
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "레보부피바카인은 심장 독성이 더 낮고 따라서 라세미 혼합물보다 더 안전하다는 사실이"
    },
    {
      "id": "p57:b9:l3:s0-0",
      "page": 57,
      "at": [
        9,
        3,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "racemate. Levobupivacaine can be synthesized from the natural amino acid ",
      "rect": [
        70.8239974975586,
        228.50332641601562,
        404.7619934082031,
        240.724609375
      ],
      "point": [
        70.8239974975586,
        238.3399658203125
      ],
      "font": "Times New Roman",
      "font_role": "serif",
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "밝혀졌다. 레보부피바카인은 천연 아미노산인"
    },
    {
      "id": "p57:b9:l3:s2-2",
      "page": 57,
      "at": [
        9,
        3,
        2,
        2
      ],
      "source": "-lysine.  ",
